WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,050
Thank you sir for playing chess with me

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:04,050
It eases my longing for my father

3
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:06,050
Keep calling me sir

4
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:07,050
you don't know me

5
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:10,050
Some time ago, my parents died at the mouth of zombies

6
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:12,050
Fortunately, people from the base saved me

7
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:17,060
I've been working in the logistics department and don't know anyone at the base.

8
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:19,500
My surname is Xu

9
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,500
Okay Mr. Xu

10
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:23,500
It's getting late today

11
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,500
The logistics department still has work to do tomorrow

12
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,500
It's time for me to go back and rest

13
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:32,350
Mr. Xu was very warm

14
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:35,740
My father was as warm as yours
